WEBVTT

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:00.296
His wife, who's almost due
with their first baby,

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.896
called him from inside the mall
to say she is in labor

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.440
and needs to get
to the hospital immediately.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.816
We're momentarily shocked,
apologize profusely,

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.880
and wish him luck
as he rushes toward the entrance.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.256
What just happened here?

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.640
What changed? Why is this so significant?

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.536
In our parking lot example,

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.920
our beliefs were short-circuited
by the ladder of the other individual.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.296
"My wife is in labor,
I need to get there quick,

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.296
there's a parking spot. Whew!